</select>
<select><option>a</option>
--- runtime error ---
Fatal error: `<svg>` inside `<select>`: `Html` inserted into a `<select>` holds it, and older browsers ignore it there and read what it holds as HTML, where the template that made the `Html` checked it as SVG or MathML; insert it outside the `<select>`
